  "idea": "Loom vs Tella: which screen recording tool makes better client demos",
  "text": "The head-to-head comparison between the two biggest screen recording apps. When communicating bug reports to engineers, Loom provides instant cloud sharing before you even finish talking. However, using Loom for paid course materials or sales demos leaves your footage looking flat and uninspired. Tella solves this by providing modular scene reordering, custom aspect ratios, and studio-grade subtitle generation. Pick Loom for team updates and Tella for customer content.",
